1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,100
In the spectrum of emotions, I would say joy is up there as top tier.

2
00:00:04,540 --> 00:00:08,860
Contentment is peaceful, happiness is blissful, joy is liberation.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:13,540
In the joy space, everything feels pleasurable and anything seems possible.

4
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,360
The experience is not meant to be long-lasting, but its impact is long-sustaining.

5
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:22,360
It reminds us of all that is good and lovely and beautiful.

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:27,740
It lifts us like wind under brightly colored wings and carries us above our sorrows,

7
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,340
lifting us, expanding us, energizing us.

8
00:00:30,480 --> 00:00:38,000
And then like rich oxygen, that's the thick of subsidized feeling charges the crisis in our bodies, our organs, our bones.

9
00:00:38,320 --> 00:00:42,080
It sparks the electrical waves that blow up and down our nervous system.

10
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:48,300
It infuses each of our trillions of cells with the sheer incredibleness of being alive.

11
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:53,560
I am of a mind that much of what we need to face our foe is not to be learned, but remembered.

12
00:00:53,560 --> 00:01:00,220
And it is knowledge that they have worked tirelessly for centuries to suppress, but that our cells still possess.

13
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:07,240
May we all use this portal of possibility that we are existing in to expand our souls' capabilities to connect.

14
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:10,980
I invite you to head on over to Substack and read the entire essay,

15
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,880
New Moon Musings, Shaking Up the Joy Space.

